      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6478865::web::028::conclusions_and_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L12 precipitates will be uniformly distributed within the fcc phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fcc phase is relatively soft and ductile, whereas the B2 phase is hard.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine L12 precipitates impede dislocation motion through an Orowan bowing and bypass mechanism.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6478865::web::029::conclusions_and_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of nanoscale L12 precipitates increases the alloy's yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6478865::web::028::conclusions_and_summary",
        "PMC6478865::web::029::conclusions_and_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintained precipitate coherence at phase boundaries preserves work hardening and prevents premature strain localization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed aging treatment will improve yield strength by approximately 20% relative to the as-cast state.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed aging treatment will maintain or improve tensile ductility relative to the as-cast state.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6478865::web::029::conclusions_and_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aged fcc+L12+B2+bcc microstructure can exhibit about 1000 MPa yield strength, 1400 MPa ultimate tensile strength, and 13% elongation under quasi-static loading.",
